charts/wire-ingress: Use ListenerSets for all application listeners (including federation and HTTP01) and client/backend traffic policies. Requires Envoy Gateway >= 1.9; the supported combination for Envoy Gateway 1.9 is Kubernetes 1.33–1.36 with Gateway API 1.6.1 CRDs. Later Envoy Gateway releases must use their corresponding upstream compatibility matrix. Gateway ownership remains only for infrastructure, the required route-denying placeholder, and EnvoyPatchPolicy targets. Federation requires extensionApis.enableLua=true in the Envoy Gateway controller configuration.
